{"id":"u-6a82a6ff-35b2-4891-a80b-a51c41f89146","src":"community","title":"Pickleball workout ni Kyjo","author":"Kyjo V.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/YVzhUw-pikolball-workout-ni-kyjo","desc":"Weekly Progression\n\nWeeks 1–3\n\nIncrease weight when all prescribed reps are completed at the target RPE.\n\nWeek 1: Technique First\n\nWeek 2: +2.5–5 lb on upper lifts; +5–10 lb on lower lifts (if RPE allows)\n\nWeek 3: Repeat progression if RPE ≤8 (Highest volume week)\n\nWeek 4: Deload \n* Reduce volume by 50%.\n* Keep movement speed high.\n* No training to failure.\n\nWeek 5-7: Adjust rep ranges to emphasize strength and speed:\n* Main lifts: 5×3 @ RPE 8.\n* Assistance: 3×6–8.\n* Add one set to jumps and medicine ball work.\n\nWeek 8: Deload\n\nWeek 9: Shift toward power:\n* Main lifts: 4×2–3 @ RPE 8.\n* Pair heavy lifts with explosive movements (contrast training), e.g., Front Squat → Box Jump; Trap Bar Deadlift → Broad Jump.\n* Reduce accessory volume to stay fresh for pickleball.\n\nWeek 12: Reduce lifting volume by 60% and maintain movement quality. \nTest:\n* Broad jump.\n* 10 m sprint.\n* 5-10-5 shuttle.\n* Rotational medicine ball throw.\n* Single-leg calf raises to fatigue.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Strength","Muscle","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-02T02:04:59.331Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower Body Strength + Speed","Upper Body Strength + Rotation","Lower Body Power + Agility","Upper Body Athleticism + Injur"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Box Jump","sets":[{"r":3,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Front Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":4}],"note":"Tempo 3-1-0"},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}],"note":"90 sec rest"},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}],"note":"90 secs"},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":6,"x":3}],"note":"45 sec rest"},{"n":"Tibi